      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "RAPID LULU (7) tends to take a while to wind up, running on to place two back before spotting a start latest and finishing on strongly into second (20.02) in a Mix 5 at this track. Solid record at the distance winning three races. Consistent performer from this draw with a win and two minor placings to her credit. Overdue and gets her chance. IT'S THE ZIGGY (1) drifted back from the inside but sliced through to hit the frame when a 5 length third (20.13) at this track in Mix 5. Expecting another good run. GO GO CAMBLA (2) stalked lead from an outside box last start before finishing second (23.99) at Rockhampton in a Grade 4 over 407m. Solid formlines coming through her last run. Hard to beat again. MAJESTIC ZEAL (5) warrants respect with the drop in distance.",
